---
const links = [
  ["GitHub 仓库", "https://github.com/Osmantic/ODS"],
  ["Osmantic", "https://osmantic.com"],
  ["演示视频", "https://youtu.be/nO8xFNHX-HA"],
  ["安全公告", "https://github.com/Osmantic/ODS/security/advisories"],
  ["许可说明", "https://github.com/Osmantic/ODS/blob/main/ods/LICENSING.md"],
  ["贡献", "https://github.com/Osmantic/ODS/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md"],
];
---

<footer class="relative overflow-hidden">
  <div class="atmosphere">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-350 px-5 pt-24 sm:px-8 lg:pt-32">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[1.1fr_0.9fr] lg:gap-20">
        <div>
          <h2
            class="reveal max-w-[18ch] font-display text-[clamp(2.1rem,4.6vw,3.8rem)] font-bold leading-[1.1] tracking-tighter"
          >
            在你自己的硬件上，
            <span class="text-amber">运行你自己的 AI。</span>
          </h2>
          <p class="reveal mt-6 max-w-[46ch] text-[16px] leading-loose text-muted">
            无需上云。无需订阅。推理过程、聊天记录与你的文件都留在你自己的机器上。
          </p>
          <div class="reveal mt-9 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3.5">
            <a
              href="/#top"
              class="btn-tactile btn-sheen group gap-2.5 rounded-full bg-amber px-6 py-3.5 text-[15px] font-semibold text-base-950 shadow-[0_12px_32px_-8px_rgba(224,162,74,0.45)] hover:shadow-[0_18px_44px_-10px_rgba(224,162,74,0.55)]"
            >
              <span>获取安装命令</span>
              <svg class="h-4 w-4 transition-transform duration-200 group-hover:-translate-y-0.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
                <line x1="12" y1="19" x2="12" y2="5"></line>
                <polyline points="5 12 12 5 19 12"></polyline>
              </svg>
            </a>
            <a
              href="https://github.com/Osmantic/ODS"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
              class="btn-tactile group gap-2.5 rounded-full border border-line bg-base-900/60 px-5 py-3.5 text-[15px] text-ink shadow-[inset_0_1px_0_rgba(255,255,255,0.05)] hover:border-amber/50 hover:text-amber"
            >
              <svg
                class="h-4 w-4 text-faint transition-colors duration-200 group-hover:text-amber"
                viewBox="0 0 16 16"
                fill="currentColor"
                aria-hidden="true"
              >
                <path d="M8 0C3.58 0 0 3.58 0 8c0 3.54 2.29 6.53 5.47 7.59.4.07.55-.17.55-.38 0-.19-.01-.82-.01-1.49-2.01.37-2.53-.49-2.69-.94-.09-.23-.48-.94-.82-1.13-.28-.15-.68-.52-.01-.53.63-.01 1.08.58 1.23.82.72 1.21 1.87.87 2.33.66.07-.52.28-.87.51-1.07-1.78-.2-3.64-.89-3.64-3.95 0-.87.31-1.59.82-2.15-.08-.2-.36-1.02.08-2.12 0 0 .67-.21 2.2.82.64-.18 1.32-.27 2-.27.68 0 1.36.09 2 .27 1.53-1.04 2.2-.82 2.2-.82.44 1.1.16 1.92.08 2.12.51.56.82 1.27.82 2.15 0 3.07-1.87 3.75-3.65 3.95.29.25.54.73.54 1.48 0 1.07-.01 1.93-.01 2.2 0 .21.15.46.55.38A8.013 8.013 0 0016 8c0-4.42-3.58-8-8-8z" />
              </svg>
              <span>Star on GitHub</span>
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="reveal lg:pt-4">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 font-mono text-[11px] tracking-[0.18em] text-faint">
            <span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-moss" />
            <span>STATUS</span>
          </div>
          <div class="mt-4 space-y-3">
            {
              [
                ["ODS V3", "预发布 · v3.0.0"],
                ["许可", "Apache-2.0 + Pixel ODS-only"],
                ["遥测", "不收集任何遥测数据"],
                ["平台", "Linux · Windows(WSL2) · macOS"],
              ].map(([k, v], idx) => (
                <div class="flex items-baseline justify-between gap-6 border-b border-line pb-3">
                  <span class="font-mono text-[12px] text-faint">{k}</span>
                  <span class="flex items-center gap-2 text-right text-[13.5px] text-ink">
                    {idx === 0 && (
                      <span class="relative flex h-1.5 w-1.5">
                        <span class="animate-live-ping absolute inline-flex h-full w-full rounded-full bg-moss opacity-75"></span>
                        <span class="relative inline-flex h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-moss"></span>
                      </span>
                    )}
                    {v}
                  </span>
                </div>
              ))
            }
          </div>

          <ul class="mt-8 grid grid-cols-2 gap-x-6 gap-y-3">
            {
              links.map(([label, href]) => (
                <li>
                  <a
                    href={href}
                    target="_blank"
                    rel="noopener noreferrer"
                    class="text-[13.5px] text-muted transition-colors duration-200 hover:text-amber"
                  >
                    {label}
                  </a>
                </li>
              ))
            }
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div
        class="mt-20 flex flex-col gap-4 border-t border-line py-8 text-[12.5px] text-faint sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between"
      >
        <p>
          ODS 代码采用 Apache-2.0，捆绑的 Pixel 源代码拥有独立的仅限 ODS 的使用与分发授权。
        </p>
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4 sm:justify-end">
          <p class="font-mono">
            由 Osmantic 与那群拒绝租用本应被拥有的东西的人共同打造。
          </p>
          <a
            href="/#top"
            aria-label="回到页面顶部"
            class="btn-tactile flex h-8 w-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-line bg-base-900/60 text-faint hover:border-amber/50 hover:text-amber"
          >
            <svg class="h-3.5 w-3.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
              <polyline points="18 15 12 9 6 15"></polyline>
            </svg>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="overflow-hidden px-5 pb-2 sm:px-8" aria-hidden="true">
        <span
          class="block whitespace-nowrap text-center font-display text-[clamp(4rem,14vw,12rem)] font-bold leading-none tracking-tighter text-transparent"
          style="-webkit-text-stroke: 1px color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-amber) 25%, var(--color-line));"
          >ODS</span
        >
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
